    <string name="api_explain">Lets an agent or script on this phone read passages, search, get a passage as text or as the share image, read study notes and manage bookmarks: what the app does, over HTTP. Each caller gets its own key, and every tool is off for a key until you switch it on. Off by default; the app makes no connection of its own either way.</string>
